    · intro R R₁ hR hR₁
      subst hR₁
      exact ⟨by linarith only [hR], by linarith only [hR], by linarith only [hR], by linarith only [hR],
        by linarith only [hR], by linarith only [hR], by linarith only [hR], by linarith only [hR],
