          |s| ≤ na * K → e * e * p + (e * t + e * t) * q - (e * e * na ^ 2 + (e * t + e * t) * s)
            + e * e * na ^ 2 ≤ e * e * (5 * nf ^ 2 + na ^ 2 / 8) + 17 * G ^ 2 * K ^ 2) ∧
        -- summing the pointwise Caccioppoli inequality over `j`
