  -- `w_t = t⁻¹(u(· + tv) - u)` satisfy uniform `C^{1,α}` bounds on `B_{R/32}(x)` (the `C^{1,α}`
  -- estimate on `B_{R/8}(x)`), so by `codim1_hcp_sr_difference_quotient` `Du` is `C¹` on
  -- `B_{R/64}(x)` with `α`-Hölder derivative.
