  -- step 5: (T1) gives `φ` and a limit `μ` with `limsupⱼ μ_{φ(j)}(K) ≤ μ(K)` for compact `K`
  obtain ⟨φ, μ, hφ, -, hμK, -, hμlimsup, -⟩ := hT1 P U (fun j => (R j).measure) hU hsupK
  -- step 6: (SL) slices `T_{φ(j)}` and `T` by `f`
