    · -- `dγ(Φ y)(E) = Σᵢ (-1)ⁱ D[γ(·)(removeNth i E)](Φ y)(e_{ι i})`; match the terms with the
      -- chain rule `DFᵢ(y) eᵢ = (-1)ⁱ D[γ(·)(E ∘ succAbove i)](Φ y)(L eᵢ)`
      rw [exteriorDerivative_apply ((hγ.differentiable hr) _)]
