  strictly increasing `ι : Fin (m + 1) → Fin P` put `J_j = ι ∘ j.succAbove` (the `j`-th index
  dropped) and `ε_j = (-1)^j dx^{J_j}`, with `dx^{J_j}` from `Submission.cmr_cc_det_covector_exists`.
