`cbrcs_cutoff_extension` turns them into integer multiplicity currents in `ℝᴾ` supported in
`B̄_r(x₀)`, with `M(E Sⱼ) ≤ M(Sⱼ)`, `M(∂(E Sⱼ)) ≤ M(∂Sⱼ)` and `E Sⱼ ⇀ E A`; their boundaries are
