    · -- Cartan: `ζ G_j^# ω − ζ F_j^# ω − d(ζ K_j ω) = K_j(dω)` on `E`
      have hcart := fun j => hcartan P k (Fs j) (Gs j) (ω : DifferentialForm (Euclid P) (k + 1))
        (hFs j) (hGs j) ω.property.1.1
